      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're not alone in feeling this way. Sometimes, the weight of everything can feel too heavy to bear. If you ever feel like you're drowning, remember that there's no rush. You don't have to face this alone. Sometimes, it's okay to let go and just... be. It's okay to feel this way.",
